        "id": "Q3",
        "answer": "The user gives conditional permission to post the Linden rota: Fenn must first approve the allergy card, and the kitchen lead must verify utensil separation. Both conditions are necessary because shared utensils can invalidate the meal plan. The allergy card must also add the separate-utensil step, and the rota must remain private until the kitchen review. The assistant’s claim that posting was complete because the local preview finished does not establish these conditions were met: the user says the preview receipt evidences only the recorded local operation. A separate correction changes the recorded value without changing the rota’s closed status.",
